## Strongly reciprocal hardware license

The CERN OHL S 2.0 is a strongly reciprocal open hardware license.

You may study, use, make, modify and distribute hardware based on the covered hardware design files, subject to the terms of the CERN OHL S 2.0.

If you convey modified hardware design files or products based on them, you must comply with the source availability and reciprocity obligations of the CERN OHL S 2.0.

